    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Schnittger Bourne is pleased to present 14 La Touche Cove to the lettings market. Set in a truly spectacular location overlooking the Wicklow coastline, this turnkey townhouse is ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nSpread over four floors, No. 14 is set against the backdrop of the renovated former La Touche Hotel and directly opposite The Cove beach in Greystones.\r\n\r\nIn addition to being in a much sought-after location, it benefits from an air to water heat pump system, Lutron RA2 personalised smart lighting system, security alarm, and avails of two parking spaces. The finishes throughout are top-of-the-range, with accommodation on the ground floor comprising an open plan kitchen/living room, utility room, reception room, under-stairs storage and WC. Engineered hardwood floors run throughout the entire ground floor, which features bespoke elements throughout.\r\n\r\nThe first and second floors incorporate a master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, double bedroom with ensuite, guest double bedroom with walk-in wardrobe, living space with access to top floor, and high-specification main bathroom. All the bedrooms are finished in calming, neutral tones.\r\n\r\nThe top floor offers itself up as a home office, yoga studio, or simply a perfect entertainment space. It boasts a floor to ceiling double doors leading out to a sun-soaked terrace which overlooks the famous Cove beach and Bray head.\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nNestled alongside the bustling seafront and Greystones main street, La Touche Cove is centrally located and a two-minute stroll from the train station as well as a wide variety of top-class restaurants, pubs, cafes, boutiques, pharmacies, supermarkets, and a small theatre. Voted as one the most liveable communities in 2021 (LivCom Awards) Greystones is less than an hour outside Dublin City Centre and caters to a diverse and active lifestyle. The property is well placed for an abundance of sporting activities including rugby, GAA, tennis, soccer, and sailing. The community Shoreline Swimming Pool and Leisure Complex is popular for its well-equipped gym and swimming facilities, and there is a host golf clubs in the neighbourhood, such as Greystones Golf Club and the famous Druids Glen Golf Resort - a ten-minute journey by car. Transport links include DART, Dublin Bus and Aircoach, all of which are a five minute walk from the property - and there is also easy access to the N11 and M50."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\nKitchen/Living Room\r\nHardwood flooring, media unit, Quartz countertops, sleek custom-made cabinetry, NEFF appliances including integrated double and hob, integrated fridge/freezer and dishwasher, undermounted stainless steel sink, breakfast bar, pendant lighting, recessed lighting, floor-to-ceiling sliding door leading to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility/Laundry Room\r\nIntegrated washing machine, built-in cabinetry, and storage.\r\n\r\nReception Room\r\nHardwood flooring, large picture window.\r\n\r\nWC\r\nTiled flooring, vanity unit with undermounted wash-hand basin, WC, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom\r\nCarpet flooring, large picture windows with views of the sea, central ceiling pendant lighting, recessed lighting, walk-in wardrobe.\r\nEn Suite Walk-in wet-room style shower, flooring and walls tiled in natural stone, vanity unit with wash-hand basin, WC, recessed lighting, heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nCarpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, recessed lighting.\r\nEn Suite Walk-in wet-room style shower, flooring and walls tiled in natural stone, vanity unit with wash-hand basin, LED mirror, WC, heated towel rail, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nCarpet flooring, central ceiling pendant lighting, walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (Living Space with stair access to top floor)\r\nCarpet flooring, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\nFreestanding bath, walk-in shower, tiled flooring and walls in natural stone, vanity unit with wash-hand basin, WC, recessed lighting, heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nTop Floor Sunroom\r\nCarpet flooring, recessed lighting, double doors out to roof terrace."
      },
